#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:0
msgid ""
"Add a PPA or other third-party software repository to Ubuntu Desktop, and "
"understand the security risks of untrusted sources."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:8
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"Previously linked: https://help.ubuntu.com/community/Repositories/Ubuntu, "
"https://help.ubuntu.com/community/Repositories/CommandLine\n"
"-->\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:12
msgid "Topics: Software"
msgstr "話題：軟體"

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:16
msgid "Add a software repository"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:18
msgid ""
"In addition to official Ubuntu sources, software is also available from "
"third-party, community-maintained sources. If you want to install software "
"from a third-party software repository, you must add it to Ubuntu's list of "
"available repositories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:21
msgid "Only add software repositories from **sources that you trust**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:23
msgid ""
"Third-party software repositories are **not checked for security or "
"reliability** by Ubuntu members, and may contain software which is harmful "
"to your computer. By enabling the repository, you're giving access to your "
"system to the repository owners."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:25
msgid ""
"If possible, install {ref}`snap packages <snap-and-deb-packages>` instead. "
"These are confined for security."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:29
msgid "Add a PPA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:31
msgid ""
"Personal Package Archives (PPAs) are software repositories designed for "
"Ubuntu users and are easier to install than other third-party repositories. "
"PPAs are often used to distribute pre-release software so that it can be "
"tested."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:34
msgid ""
"For other use cases, we recommend that you install confined {ref}`snap "
"packages <snap-and-deb-packages>` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:0
msgid "Graphical interface"
msgstr "圖形化介面"

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:42
#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:59
msgid ""
"On the PPA's overview page, look for the {guilabel}`Adding this PPA to your "
"system` heading. Copy the PPA's location, which should look similar to: "
"`ppa:mozillateam/firefox-next`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:44
#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:99
msgid ""
"Install the `software-properties-gtk` package, which provides the Software & "
"Updates application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:46
#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:101
msgid "Open the Software & Updates application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:48
#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:103
msgid "Switch to the Other Software tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:50
msgid ""
"Click {guilabel}`Add` and enter the PPA's location that you copied earlier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:52
#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:111
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Add Source`. Enter your password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:54
msgid ""
"Close the Software & Updates window. App Center will then check your "
"software sources for new software, including the PPA that you've just added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:0
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行"

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:61
msgid "Enable the PPA using the `add-apt-repository` tool:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:63
msgid ""
" <!--\n"
" Should be installed by default. On older or minimal Ubuntu releases, you "
"may have to install software-properties-common and/or python-software-"
"properties first:\n"
" sudo apt-get install python-software-properties\n"
" -->\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:76
msgid ""
"Replace `ppa:<user>/<repo-name>` with the PPA's location that you copied "
"earlier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:78
msgid ""
"Check your software sources for new software, including the PPA that you've "
"just added:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:89
msgid "You can now install software from the PPA."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:91
msgid "Add a third-party repository other than PPA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:93
msgid ""
"You can find many software repositories for Ubuntu outside of the PPA "
"platform. These are managed using standard Debian tools, and they require "
"more manual steps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:96
msgid ""
"Before you enable a third-party repository, we recommend that you check if "
"the software is available as a confined {ref}`snap packages <snap-and-deb-"
"packages>` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:105
msgid ""
"Click {guilabel}`Add` and enter the APT line for the repository. This should "
"be available from the website of the repository, and should look similar to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:107
msgid "deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ questing main\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:113
msgid ""
"Close the Software & Updates window. App Center will then check your "
"software sources for new software."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/add-a-software-repository.md:115
msgid ""
"Check if the repository provides a signing key (GPG key) to be able to "
"verify downloaded packages. Follow possible instructions on how to download "
"and install the signing key."
msgstr ""
